{"id":94,"verses":[{"number":1,"arabicText":" أَلَمْ نَشْرَحْ لَكَ صَدْرَكَ","transliteration":"Alam nashraḥ laka ṣadrak","translation":"Have We not uplifted your heart for you ˹O Prophet˺"},{"number":2,"arabicText":"وَوَضَعْنَا عَنكَ وِزْرَكَ","transliteration":"Wawaḍaʿnā ʿanka wiz'rak","translation":"relieved you of the burden"},{"number":3,"arabicText":"ٱلَّذِىٓ أَنقَضَ ظَهْرَكَ","transliteration":"Alladhī anqaḍa ẓahrak","translation":"which weighed so heavily on your back"},{"number":4,"arabicText":"وَرَفَعْنَا لَكَ ذِكْرَكَ","transliteration":"Warafaʿnā laka dhik'rak","translation":"and elevated your renown for you"},{"number":5,"arabicText":"فَإِنَّ مَعَ ٱلْعُسْرِ يُسْرًا","transliteration":"Fa-inna maʿa l-ʿus'ri yus'rā","translation":"So, surely with hardship comes ease"},{"number":6,"arabicText":"إِنَّ مَعَ ٱلْعُسْرِ يُسْرًا","transliteration":"Inna maʿa l-ʿus'ri yus'rā","translation":"Surely with ˹that˺ hardship comes ˹more˺ ease"},{"number":7,"arabicText":"فَإِذَا فَرَغْتَ فَٱنصَبْ","transliteration":"Fa-idhā faraghta fa-inṣab","translation":"So once you have fulfilled ˹your duty˺, strive ˹in devotion˺"},{"number":8,"arabicText":"وَإِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ فَٱرْغَب","transliteration":"Wa-ilā rabbika fa-ir'ghab","translation":"turning to your Lord ˹alone˺ with hope"}]}